+                               verbose=less(verbose,10));
+     fit <- attr(muT, 'modelFit');
+     mu[use] <- muT;
+ }

Error: nbrOfGenotypeGroups == 3 is not TRUE

When you plot the density of the B Allele Frequencies (as you have adviced to Rico) you can clearly see that there are not 3 distinct genotypes (plot is added as attachment). But this is actually the truth for my samples as they are inbred-mice and should be (almost) completely homozygous. I have no clue how to proceed with generating the TumorBoosed BAF's for my tumor samples and hope you can give me any kind of advice.

